---
source: cli/src/main.rs
expression: "errors.join(\"\\n\")"
---
better-codex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `better-codex fork`, `better-codex exec`, and `better-codex exec fork`
better-codex fork --worktree: `better-codex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
better-codex fork --worktree --last: `better-codex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
better-codex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `better-codex exec fork --worktree`
better-codex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
better-codex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `better-codex fork`, `better-codex exec`, and `better-codex exec fork`
better-codex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `better-codex fork`, `better-codex exec`, and `better-codex exec fork`
better-codex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `better-codex fork`, `better-codex exec`, and `better-codex exec fork`
